<title>USA: CCC awards 24 tonnes butter for Asia, ex-USSR.</title>
<headline>CCC awards 24 tonnes butter for Asia, ex-USSR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commodity Credit Corp said it accepted a bid from a U.S. exporter for 24 tonnes of butter to Asia and the former Soviet Union.</p>
<p>A bonus of $750 per tonne was awarded to the HZ Trading Co Inc, according to Agriculture Department.</p>
<p>Delivery is scheduled April 2-May 31. The agency said Asia and the former USSR have a balance under the Dairy Export Incentive Program of 18,551 tonnes.</p>
<p>((--Washington commodities desk, 202-898-8394))</p>
</text>
